'''Mōna''' is one of the two [[wikipedia:deity|deities]] in [[Sunneism]] and the personification of the [[Mōna|moon of the same name]]. She is female, representing feminity, and is married to [[Sunne (god)|Sunne]], with whom she created [[Basis (Sunneism)|Basis]], the mortal realm. 

